<div class="col-head t-3" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-star"/></svg><span data-i18n="track3">Melodi</span></div>
<button type="button" class="clip t-3 is-off" data-t="3" data-c="0" aria-pressed="false"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-star"/></svg><span class="vh pad-label"></span><span class="vh pad-state"></span><span class="progress" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
<button type="button" class="clip t-3 is-off" data-t="3" data-c="1" aria-pressed="false"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-star"/></svg><span class="vh pad-label"></span><span class="vh pad-state"></span><span class="progress" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
<button type="button" class="clip t-3 is-off" data-t="3" data-c="2" aria-pressed="false"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-star"/></svg><span class="vh pad-label"></span><span class="vh pad-state"></span><span class="progress" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
<button type="button" class="clip t-3 is-off" data-t="3" data-c="3" aria-pressed="false"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-star"/></svg><span class="vh pad-label"></span><span class="vh pad-state"></span><span class="progress" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
</div>
<div class="controls">
<button type="button" id="stop"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-stop"/></svg><span data-i18n="stop">Berhenti</span></button>
<button type="button" id="resume" data-i18n="resume" hidden>Ketuk untuk lanjut bermain</button>
</div>
</section>
<p id="hint-silent" data-i18n="silent">Tidak ada suara? Minta orang dewasa memeriksa suaranya.</p>
<footer id="about">
<p class="alm-grownups" data-i18n="grownUps">Untuk orang dewasa: pelankan volume, terutama saat memakai headphone.</p>
<p class="alm-unofficial" data-i18n="unofficial">Tidak resmi. Tidak dibuat oleh atau berafiliasi dengan Ableton.</p>
